{"id":"n26802-2-7","stage":0,"title":"곧 · 马上","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n26802-2-7-1","ko":"저는 곧 내리니 여기에 앉으세요.","zh":"我马上就下车了，您坐这儿吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"저는","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저는","audio":"/audio/0b05af6c0b14d6e70820.mp3"}},{"text":"곧","meaning":"就，马上，即将","explanation":"곧：就，马上，即将。","readings":[{"term":"곧","audio":"/audio/c2f53c24d77970856333.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26802","senseId":"2","lemma":"곧","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"곧","audio":"/audio/c2f53c24d77970856333.mp3"}},{"text":"내리니","meaning":"要下车，所以","explanation":"내리다：从乘坐的车上下来；-니 在这里说明原因。곧 내리니 即“马上要下车，所以……”。","readings":[{"term":"내리다","audio":"/audio/01d776172b3f93c3c9d5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73353","senseId":"4","lemma":"내리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내리니","audio":"/audio/b03b3690cae54297593a.mp3"}},{"text":"여기에","meaning":"这里，这儿","explanation":"여기：这里，这儿；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"여기","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17863","senseId":"1","lemma":"여기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"여기에","audio":"/audio/89d8715c5ec0d5fb9df5.mp3"}},{"text":"앉으세요.","meaning":"坐","explanation":"앉다：坐；으세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"앉다","audio":"/audio/17e77d3fb6b2dbdb6258.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71463","senseId":"1","lemma":"앉다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"앉으세요","audio":"/audio/deec845be5a605dea90f.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"44506","definition":"说话人在听话人面前对自己的谦称。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"c2f53c24d7797085","term":"곧","zh":"就，马上，即将","audio":"/audio/c2f53c24d77970856333.mp3","entryId":"26802","definition":"时间没过多久。","pronunciation":["곧"]},{"id":"01d776172b3f93c3","term":"내리다","zh":"从车上下来、下车","audio":"/audio/01d776172b3f93c3c9d5.mp3","entryId":"73353","definition":"从车上下来、下车","pronunciation":["내리다"]},{"id":"c13089162f79c617","term":"여기","zh":"这里，这儿","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3","entryId":"17863","definition":"指代与说话人较近的地方。","pronunciation":["여기"]},{"id":"17e77d3fb6b2dbdb","term":"앉다","zh":"坐","audio":"/audio/17e77d3fb6b2dbdb6258.mp3","entryId":"71463","definition":"挺直上半身，将臀部置于别的物体或地上以支持身体的重量。","pronunciation":["안따"]}],"audio":"/audio/7b6e8c16da002ebfd630.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n26802-2-7-2","ko":"고마워요, 젊은이.","zh":"谢谢您，年轻人。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"고마워요,","meaning":"感谢，感激","explanation":"고맙다：感谢，感激；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"고맙다","audio":"/audio/ded2b4943e89f57dd33d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20041","senseId":"1","lemma":"고맙다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"고마워요","audio":"/audio/3f7c2c9d4d32045f28cd.mp3"}},{"text":"젊은이.","meaning":"青年人，年轻人","explanation":"젊은이：青年人，年轻人。","readings":[{"term":"젊은이","audio":"/audio/0f57b2c723069e07217c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49313","senseId":"1","lemma":"젊은이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"젊은이","audio":"/audio/0f57b2c723069e07217c.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"ded2b4943e89f57d","term":"고맙다","zh":"感谢，感激","audio":"/audio/ded2b4943e89f57dd33d.mp3","entryId":"20041","definition":"因别人为自己做了什么，内心感到很满足，并想给予回报。","pronunciation":["고ː맙따"]},{"id":"0f57b2c723069e07","term":"젊은이","zh":"青年人，年轻人","audio":"/audio/0f57b2c723069e07217c.mp3","entryId":"49313","definition":"年纪轻的人。","pronunciation":["절므니"]}],"audio":"/audio/6e60c64a083b2afba055.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":1.697,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=26802","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"http